{{> breadcrumbs}}

<h1 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">MCP Setup</h1>

<div class="prose max-w-none">
  <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow p-6 mb-6">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-3">What is MCP?</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-600">The Model Context Protocol (MCP) lets AI assistants like Claude interact with external tools and data sources. By connecting Claude Code to Lorekeeper's MCP server, the AI can create worlds, build characters, generate stories, and manage lore — all through natural conversation.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow p-6 mb-6">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-3">Connection Instructions</h2>
    <ol class="list-decimal list-inside space-y-3 text-gray-600">
      <li>Open your Claude Code MCP settings file at <code class="bg-gray-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm">.claude/settings.json</code></li>
      <li>Add the Lorekeeper MCP server configuration:
        <pre class="bg-gray-900 text-green-400 rounded-lg p-4 mt-2 overflow-x-auto text-sm"><code>{
  "mcpServers": {
    "lorekeeper": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["tsx", "{{projectPath}}/src/mcp-server.ts"],
      "env": {
        "DATABASE_URL": "file:{{projectPath}}/prisma/dev.db"
      }
    }
  }
}</code></pre>
      </li>
      <li>Restart Claude Code to pick up the new server</li>
      <li>Test the connection by asking Claude: "List all worlds in Lorekeeper"</li>
    </ol>
  </div>

  <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow p-6 mb-6">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-3">Available Tools</h2>

    <h3 class="font-medium text-gray-800 mt-4 mb-2">CRUD Tools</h3>
    <div class="grid gap-2">
      <div class="text-sm"><code class="text-blue-600">list_worlds</code> — List all worlds</div>
      <div class="text-sm"><code class="text-blue-600">get_world</code> — Get world details and stats</div>
      <div class="text-sm"><code class="text-blue-600">create_world</code> — Create a new world</div>
      <div class="text-sm"><code class="text-blue-600">update_world</code> — Update world name/description</div>
      <div class="text-sm"><code class="text-blue-600">delete_world</code> — Delete a world and all contents</div>
      <div class="text-sm"><code class="text-blue-600">list_characters</code> — List characters in a world</div>
      <div class="text-sm"><code class="text-blue-600">get_character</code> — Get character with description</div>
      <div class="text-sm"><code class="text-blue-600">create_character</code> — Create a character</div>
      <div class="text-sm"><code class="text-blue-600">update_character</code> — Update character</div>
      <div class="text-sm"><code class="text-blue-600">delete_character</code> — Delete a character</div>
      <div class="text-sm"><code class="text-blue-600">list_locations</code> — List locations in a world</div>
      <div class="text-sm"><code class="text-blue-600">get_location</code> — Get location with description</div>
      <div class="text-sm"><code class="text-blue-600">create_location</code> — Create a location</div>
      <div class="text-sm"><code class="text-blue-600">update_location</code> — Update location</div>
      <div class="text-sm"><code class="text-blue-600">delete_location</code> — Delete a location</div>
      <div class="text-sm"><code class="text-blue-600">list_stories</code> — List stories in a world</div>
      <div class="text-sm"><code class="text-blue-600">get_story</code> — Get story with related data</div>
      <div class="text-sm"><code class="text-blue-600">delete_story</code> — Delete a story</div>
      <div class="text-sm"><code class="text-blue-600">list_lore</code> — List lore artifacts (filterable)</div>
      <div class="text-sm"><code class="text-blue-600">update_lore_status</code> — Keep or discard lore</div>
    </div>

    <h3 class="font-medium text-gray-800 mt-4 mb-2">Generation Tools</h3>
    <div class="grid gap-2">
      <div class="text-sm"><code class="text-blue-600">get_world_context</code> — Full world context for AI generation</div>
      <div class="text-sm"><code class="text-blue-600">save_story</code> — Save a generated story with character/location links</div>
      <div class="text-sm"><code class="text-blue-600">save_lore_artifacts</code> — Save a batch of lore artifacts from a story</div>
    </div>

    <h3 class="font-medium text-gray-800 mt-4 mb-2">Advisory Tools</h3>
    <div class="grid gap-2">
      <div class="text-sm"><code class="text-blue-600">check_consistency</code> — World data for consistency review</div>
      <div class="text-sm"><code class="text-blue-600">suggest_connections</code> — Character/location data for connection suggestions</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
